            <title>[IGNITE-5357] Replicated cache reads load balancing.</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-5357</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Currently all read requests from client node to replicated cache will go through primary node for key.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Need to select random affinity node in topology and send request here (only if readFromBackups=true)&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;If where are server nodes collocated on same host with client, must select target node from them.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
